PolishParty.stanceView(Q, 'pils_influence');
!}

= Piłsudski’s Influence

The present line: **[+ pl_stance_current +]**. A new declaration changes no law in force and gives no reform by itself.

- @support
- @conditional
- @oppose_military_interference
- @easy_discard

@support
title: Support his influence
subtitle: [? if pl_stance_support_present = 1 : **Present line** Confirming it changes nothing. ?][? if pl_stance_support_present = 0 : Our relations with Piłsudski improve (at most once a year), but the Centre of the party is displeased. If a coup comes, backing Piłsudski divides the party less. Grows faster: militarism. ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'pils_influence', 'support').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_support_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'pils_influence', 'support');
!}
go-to: result

@conditional
title: Support it on conditions
subtitle: [? if pl_stance_conditional_present = 1 : **Present line** Confirming it changes nothing. ?][? if pl_stance_conditional_present = 0 : We agree to concessions to Piłsudski only with civilian control of the army or the responsibility of the government before the Sejm. ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'pils_influence', 'conditional').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_conditional_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'pils_influence', 'conditional');
!}
go-to: result

@oppose_military_interference
title: Oppose the army’s interference
subtitle: [? if pl_stance_oppose_military_interference_present = 1 : **Present line** Confirming it changes nothing. ?][? if pl_stance_oppose_military_interference_present = 0 : Our relations with Piłsudski worsen, and the Piłsudczycy in the party are displeased. While this line holds, we agree to no military power independent of the government. ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'pils_influence', 'oppose_military_interference').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_oppose_military_interference_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'pils_influence', 'oppose_military_interference');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

